            "content": "<p><strong>Size:</strong><br/>- Medium (M): 12″ wide × 8″ tall<br/>- Large (L): 16″ wide × 11″ tall<br/><br/>Each flag is carved in deep relief, the eagle, stars, and waving stripes stand proud of the surface, so there's real depth you can run your fingers across, beyond the flat measurements.<br/><br/><strong>Weight:</strong><br/>- Small: approximately 2–3 lbs<br/>- Medium: approximately 4–6 lbs<br/><br/>Because every piece is carved and finished by hand, slight variations in grain, char depth, and edge are part of each one, no two are exactly alike.</p>"
