        "accordion_7nBCpr": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Handmade in the USA",
            "content": "<p>Every flag is carved and finished by hand by Jim, a U.S. Army veteran, in small batches. The stars, stripes, and eagle are worked into solid wood in real relief, then hand-stained and sealed to last for decades.<br/><br/>No two are ever identical. Slight differences in grain, depth, and tone are the mark of genuine hand-work, not a flaw, but proof it wasn't stamped out on a line.<br/><br/>When you hang one of these, you're hanging something a veteran made with his own hands and supporting the work that keeps him at the bench.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "content": "<p>Every flag is made in small batches and checked by hand before it leaves. Orders are dispatched within 2–4 business days; delivery typically takes 7–13 days, tracked and fully insured the whole way.<br/><br/><strong>Free shipping on all U.S. orders.</strong><br/><br/><strong>Returns:</strong> We stand behind every flag. If yours arrives damaged, or just doesn't stop you in your tracks, tell us within <strong>60 days</strong> and we'll make it right with a replacement or full refund, and you won't even need to ship it back.<br/><br/><strong>Damaged in transit?</strong> Email us a photo within 48 hours and we'll handle the carrier claim and send a replacement at no cost to you.<br/></p>"
